# Pairs with EventualConvergence. Records S without re-arming the causal buffer's drain.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceRecordedLowWatermarkDoesNotRearm
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: recording a new S does not re-arm the drain, so a parked dependent waits forever
PERTURBS: Heartbeat

--- FIND
    /\ srcv' = SOf
    /\ Rearm
--- REPLACE
    /\ srcv' = SOf
    \* MUTATION: no drain re-arm.
    /\ UNCHANGED wake
--- END
